  "reviewNotes": [
    "Rows were visually checked against the 2025 order PDF table, not reconstructed from the older 514n schedule.",
    "Sex-specific specialists and risk-triggered specialists/studies are encoded as conditional entries rather than unconditional requirements.",
    "The mental-development screening at 18 months/2 years is represented as a screening study; neurologist/child-psychiatrist participation is conditional on screening risk.",
    "Tuberculosis screening and toxicology/psychoactive-substance screening are governed by separate legal acts and are not inferred into this table.",
    "This artifact structures the order's schedule only; it does not determine a patient's health group or add investigations outside the order."
